  <!-- EN: {BASELABEL}: Loyalty squad -->
  <OE_Quest_WeirdBanditCamp.root.nodes.Delay.node.parms.customLetterLabel.value.slateRef>{BASELABEL}：忠诚小队</OE_Quest_WeirdBanditCamp.root.nodes.Delay.node.parms.customLetterLabel.value.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: {BASETEXT}\n\nA cultist squad intercepted our messages, obtained our camp's coordinates, and is now heading toward our settlement.\n               -->
  <OE_Quest_WeirdBanditCamp.root.nodes.Delay.node.parms.customLetterText.value.slateRef>{BASETEXT}\n\n一队教徒截获了我们的信息，获得了我们营地的坐标，现在正朝我们的定居点前进。\n               </OE_Quest_WeirdBanditCamp.root.nodes.Delay.node.parms.customLetterText.value.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: Quest expired: [resolvedQuestName] -->
  <OE_Quest_WeirdBanditCamp.root.nodes.WorldObjectTimeout.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>任务过期：[resolvedQuestName]</OE_Quest_WeirdBanditCamp.root.nodes.WorldObjectTimeout.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: The bandit camp has packed up and moved on. The quest [resolvedQuestName] has expired. -->
  <OE_Quest_WeirdBanditCamp.root.nodes.WorldObjectTimeout.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>强盗营地已经收拾行装离开了。任务[resolvedQuestName]已过期。</OE_Quest_WeirdBanditCamp.root.nodes.WorldObjectTimeout.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: Quest failed: [resolvedQuestName] -->
  <OE_Quest_WeirdBanditCamp.root.nodes.siteDestroyed.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>任务失败：[resolvedQuestName]</OE_Quest_WeirdBanditCamp.root.nodes.siteDestroyed.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: After being discovered, the bandit camp has dispersed. The quest [resolvedQuestName] has ended. -->
  <OE_Quest_WeirdBanditCamp.root.nodes.siteDestroyed.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>被发现后，强盗营地已经散去。任务[resolvedQuestName]已结束。</OE_Quest_WeirdBanditCamp.root.nodes.siteDestroyed.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: Payment arrived -->
  <OE_Quest_WeirdBanditCamp.root.nodes.siteAllEnemiesDefeated.node.nodes.GiveRewards.customLetterLabel.slateRef>报酬已送达</OE_Quest_WeirdBanditCamp.root.nodes.siteAllEnemiesDefeated.node.nodes.GiveRewards.customLetterLabel.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: You have defeated the bandit camp!\n\nThe payment from [asker_faction_name] has arrived. -->
  <OE_Quest_WeirdBanditCamp.root.nodes.siteAllEnemiesDefeated.node.nodes.GiveRewards.customLetterText.slateRef>你已击败了强盗营地！\n\n来自[asker_faction_name]的报酬已送达。</OE_Quest_WeirdBanditCamp.root.nodes.siteAllEnemiesDefeated.node.nodes.GiveRewards.customLetterText.slateRef>
